==Battleground==
*2 [[Mega Baa Baa]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*2 [[Devil Wife|Devil Wives]] spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Condemned Peng]] spawns after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Razorback]] spawns as the boss.
**2 [[Mega Baa Baa]]s spawn, delay 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.
**5 [[Devil Wife|Devil Wives]] spawn, delay 33.33~40 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,200f</sup>.
**2 [[Tarsiriel]]s spawn, delay 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>.
**4 [[Condemned Peng]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 33.33~40 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,200f</sup>.
**2 [[Mega Baa Baa]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.
**2 [[Mega Baa Baa]]s spawn after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>, delay 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.
**2 [[Razorback]]s spawn after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>, delay 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>.
**2 [[Mega Baa Baa]]s spawn after 100 seconds<sup>3,000f</sup>, delay 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.
**2 [[Mega Baa Baa]]s spawn after 133.33 seconds<sup>4,000f</sup>, delay 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.
**2 [[Mega Baa Baa]]s spawn after 166.67 seconds<sup>5,000f</sup>, delay 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.

==Strategy==
When you hit the base, lure Razorback and jump him using your normal Razorback counters like [[Flower Cat (Special Cat)|Bombercat]] and [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Pizza Cat]]. Speed is the name of the game here, as when the support enemies arrive maintaining a stack of Bombercats gets very hard. [[Master of Mind Soractes (Special Cat)|Master of Mind Catcrates]] as per usual kills Tarsirel, a [[Talents|Talented]] [[Nymph Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Fiend Cat]] can Knockback both Tarsirel and Condemned Peng, [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]] kills Devil Wife, and Mega Baa Baa dies to everything. It's very easy to end up rushing this stage, but if another Razorback appears just send out Bombercats while you're beating up the base and you should win.

